Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo won his battle against that demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Sod.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lost everything in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I brought\Nhim here three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, bereft of father and home alike,\Nhow's he gonna muster up the will to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on the world yet, JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the sky, the two of the\Nstars were falling down.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.05,0:00:37.18,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora! Koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.05,0:00:37.18,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Two stars fall from the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.05,0:00:37.18,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light and the darkness of the sky.\NThe light and the darkness of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.26,0:00:44.85,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikari to yami no minamo suikomareteyuku
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.26,0:00:44.85,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One shining in the light, the other sinking into darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path of the path of the
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.85,0:00:50.28,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikiau you ni kasanaru hamon
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.85,0:00:50.28,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,A ripple drawing the two of them together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path of the path. Let's go.
