Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.33,0:01:07.46,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of unbridled ambition...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.88,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.88,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Demanding sacrifice!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.88,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.72,0:01:19.60,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Furueru hodo kokoro moetsukiru hodo atsuku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.72,0:01:19.60,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that burning in your soul calm the trembling of your heart
