Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.93,0:01:26.39,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.93,0:01:26.39,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,With courage coursing through your veins!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.93,0:01:26.39,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuuki de
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.39,0:01:33.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayoi naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.39,0:01:33.07,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,You cannot overcome your pain unless you can accept...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.39,0:01:33.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayou naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.07,0:01:37.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.07,0:01:37.07,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.07,0:01:37.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.23,0:01:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.07,0:01:40.87,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.07,0:01:40.87,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.67,0:01:57.68,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\pos(1370,795)\bord3.5\blur2}Episode 4: "Overdrive"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.67,0:01:57.68,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\pos(1370,795)}Episode 4: "Overdrive"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what he needs, so\NI'm gonna give it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.86,0:02:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the dead of night, but\Nthere's a lamp burning in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long's she been at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me she's been\Nwatching over him all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cracked from the damp, I'd wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must have been cooling his burns\Nround the clock for them to get like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're through the worst of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've been tending to my injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the image of...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your face reminds me of\Na girl I used to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name wouldn't happen to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran Pendleton, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran, you've really grown up? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've grown a fair sight more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet, you're still the boy you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She makes a better Florence\NNightingale than I do anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rest up, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for Speedwagon to make his exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have fainted for a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's broken, you shouldn't have caught me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you caught me long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare say old Jojo won't be lacking\Na reason to live after this reunion.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.97,0:04:12.35,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\pos(960,810)\bord3\blur2}- Whitechapel Street, London - {Jack the Ripper, aka "The Whitechapel Butcher"}{wtf kind of name is Whitechapel? Do the British people not like spaces? O_O}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.97,0:04:12.35,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\pos(960,810)}- Whitechapel Street, London - {Jack the Ripper, aka "The Whitechapel Butcher"}{wtf kind of name is Whitechapel? Do the British people not like spaces? O_O}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have made an early\Nnight of it. You hauled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most men shackle themselves\Nto petty morality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fear the consequences of their evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But some are unfettered by\Nman's laws in all their tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Become my servant, Jack the Ripper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've no further need for free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make you an instrument of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the likes of which you can't\Nbegin to imagine. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for what I shall take in return...
