Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only Speedwagon and I know what\Ntruly took place here that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deer was consumed in the inferno,\Nbut what of the accursed mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sign of it in the rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smashed by falling masonry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to put this\Nnightmare behind me. Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man, he haunts our steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, all is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Signore Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the lass at your side\Nis Signorina Pendleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:05:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You survived against the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not many men can claim that.
