Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the shock of that impact\Npush all the air from your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was already hurt, you cad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true I knocked the air out\Nof him, but he'll thank me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My broken bones feel like they're mending!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppeli, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage alone will not be\Nenough to beat the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arm was shattered, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain has subsided.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lifting this rock is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what is happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, try to limit yourself\Nto one question at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You healed yourself, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How you breathed after\NI poked you was the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why did you go to the\Ntrouble in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how did you know who I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What part of one question\Nat a time eluded you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get the answers you desire, Amico.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will show you things the likes of\Nwhich will change your destiny forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was with good reason that\NI struck you in the diaphragm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shock of the impact\Naltered your breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how did that heal my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the energy I am about\Nto demonstrate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what mischief is he planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hrgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him, Arena!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those ripples!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen water do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you see is the force that eased\Nyour pain and healed your broken bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Senore Joestar! Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
