Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That frog seems none the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Saint you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Saint?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ripple energy created by Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sent my Hamon coursing harmlessly\Nthrough Froggy to split my real target,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rock below.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact the stone\Nmask was not destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio Brando keeps it close to him even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron, is Dio still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, and he holds the mask\NI have sought for decades now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mask must be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And its master must be reduced to ash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is your destiny to fight\Nfor this righteous cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will learn to wield,\NSaint, or you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of humanity\Nis at stake. My destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of it makes any sense
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,arena
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's already suffered\Nenough at Dio's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't drag her into this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's blossoming. He's passing the\Nspare hormone energy from his healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,arm into the branch and sending\Nit into bloom and But amazingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he doesn't even realize he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boy, he is a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of what might he be capable with the\Nproper refinement of his abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rejoice, mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day, I may have found your champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With every meal, I feel\Nmy strength returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a simple thing, the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As pigs feed on grass, so\Ndoes man feed upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I, at the top of it\Nall, feed upon the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They exist to serve me\Nand quell my thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's supper time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to swell the ranks of my\Ndiabolical army and send it hence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will stand astride this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humanity will kneel at Dio Brando's feet!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.33,0:10:49.58,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(1565,855)\fad(440,0)\bord3\blur2}- 1 Week Later -
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.33,0:10:49.58,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(1565,855)\fad(440,0)}- 1 Week Later -
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so I began to study Harmon under\Nthe tutelage of the mysterious Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The training was Spartan,\Nbut I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's how it came about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, my history with the\NStone Mask has been a long one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe that\Nwas ever the case now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I harbored a great thirst for\Nadventure, as the young so often do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my good fortune\Nto travel the world as
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a member of my father's\Narchaeological team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would that we had never lain eyes\Non those Aztec ruins that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the hands that pulled that evil artifact\Ninto the light of day belonged to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One ill-fated night\Nduring the voyage home,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a man of our number succumbed to\Nhis curiosity and donned the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The change in him was immediate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rampaging through the ship, he\Nripped his companions' heads off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a bacchanalia of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifty-eight crewmen, butchered\Nin a matter of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dove into the sea to escape,\Nbut the fiend gave chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, dawn broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As he crumbled to dust in\Nthe sunlight, I saw his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to my utter horror,\Nthe demon was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cruelest ship drifted away,\Nwith the mask still aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had survived, but it was cold comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing the mask's dreadful\Npower could be unleashed again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dedicated my life to finding\Na way to stop its evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pledge led to my discovery of Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The energy we call Hamon is\Ncreated by the flow of one's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who wear the mask feed on the\Nblood of others to consume that energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon and the mask, they are\Ntwo sides of the same coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, we can overload Dio with\Nthat which animates him. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can hit Dio with enough Hamon\Nenergy, that devil will burst asunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Homo's ripples are the same form as the\Nwaves of light sent out by the sun itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bane of all vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppeli, I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teach me how to wield it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get a choice\Nin the matter, Amiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given your contentious history with\NDio, I'm sure he will be coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a poetry to this, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathing oxygenates your\Nblood. Your blood carries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the oxygen throughout your\Nbody it enriches the cells
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giving them the power to\Nkeep on living those cells
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,combine to form you like\Nripples in the water your body
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thrums with the hormone\Ncreated by proper breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all that is left is to use\Nit there's no way he could
