Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have reached me from there\Nhow did he do that zoom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:14:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,punch is a useful one I\Nmerely dislocated my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmon dulls the pain, and the\Nsurprise is well worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must maintain the rhythm of\Nyour breath, even when taking a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your mind or heart are tempestuous,\Nthe caliber of your Harmon will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, the village is called\NWind Knights Lot. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've had a string of disappearances\Nlately, people vanishing after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And folks have caught glimpses\Nof a Fool who looks like Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your final test will be one\Nof life or death, my pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll meet him in combat and lay him low.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give him hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entrance to Wyn Knight's lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll attack Dio while there's still\Nplenty of light left in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena, I left without giving\Nyou a proper farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I swear, I will return to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did we stop? Oi, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.88,0:15:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunlight can't protect us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.02,0:15:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step away from the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the blue hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That crazy blight is inside our horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's mad as a hazard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's evil, yeah, but I ain't seen\Nhim jump out of any animals so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be gathering minions, and\Nwho knows how many he might have.
