Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand aside, my young friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will do the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must feed on living flesh to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, they are in constant thrall to\Ntheir master, not unlike marionettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you lads are both as white as a sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the blood is drained from your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should cut off those useless heads
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of yours and watch it\Nspray out of your necks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, you melded corpses to\Nbay, prepare for the carnage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what's his next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must think as he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, this strategy will\Nserve you in good stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask yourself, what would be the most\Nadvantageous thing for my foe to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he blocks off the tunnel entrance,\Nwe can't retreat to the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I predicted,\Nhe's blocked our retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives are coming out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppeli!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't say nothing\Nabout fighting a pincushion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon Cutter!
