Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your blades are rather\Ndull compared to my Hamon Cutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, this creature\Nillustrates a principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine a minuscule flea, so\Nsmall that it's barely visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it they bite\Nhumans who tower over them
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without a single thought\Nto their own safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you call their behavior courageous?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hunger compelling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will tell you what courage is, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage is to look your fear in the eye\Nand know that it has no dominion over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear scatters your breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you toss your fear into the dust,\Nbreathing is the sword ever at your hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe with courage and you\Nwill never want for Hormone.
