Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A knee full of hormone to the head seems\Nto have cured this one's braggadocio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't even spill any wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you finish the creature off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way anything else\Nand you risk it coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for the slaughter?\NNot me, little pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cut you to pieces one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we're following\Nhim into that passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we will be doing no such\Nthing Jojo I I expect you to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finish off this abomination\Nwithout spilling a single drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, one last bit\Nof advice before you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were no Vikings\Nin the land of Norway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until the north wind\Nblew in and created them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If even one drop of\Nthat vino goes to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how utterly\Nyou defeat the zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will abandon you here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, listen to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you gone insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the Vikings, I will be\Nstrengthened by hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with this torch, all it's doing\Nis casting shadows to bedevil me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The torch, I'm bright as day to him.
