Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this does is\Nilluminate my position. But
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without it I haven't a\Nclue where he's lurking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or from where he'll strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in the dark I can smell\Nthe blood from his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must think like my foe,\Njust as the Baron commanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next I must master my fear,\Nlest it sap my harm on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathing is the sword at my hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little closer, and I'll be picking\Nmy teeth with your bones, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The harsh wind blowing down off of the\NArctic Ocean birthed the fearsome Vikings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only when we are tossed headlong into the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crucible of adversity do\Nwe rise to the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will a glass of\Nvino create this night?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he should fail, Dio has already won.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wine is rippling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, just like when we\Nwere training in the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's conducting the Hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It passes through the glass, my\Narm, my body, the ground itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel his vibrations in the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Hormone, all is made clear to me now.
