Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you passed the\Ntest with flying colors, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adversity has made the lad a Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.26,0:22:14.85,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.34,0:22:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.85,0:22:18.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.40,0:22:23.73,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through\Nthe sun and in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.73,0:22:26.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.40,0:22:30.91,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.37,0:22:41.96,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.96,0:22:45.51,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.51,0:22:50.84,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.84,0:22:53.47,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold in morning driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.47,0:22:57.52,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:23:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and out around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.52,0:22:59.89,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.15,0:23:03.36,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.20,0:23:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miles come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.36,0:23:05.15,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.28,0:23:11.95,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my lover will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.54,0:23:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll see you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.74,0:23:18.41,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.17,0:23:24.84,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.84,0:23:27.05,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,There with you
